@startuml
title exact-orb — N6/N10: конкурирующие build A и B, latest accepted build wins

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B
    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

box "CLIENT / API" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch
    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
    control "ProfileService" as Profile
end box

box "SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "Session Store" as Store
end box

box "CALCULATION" #FFF7CC
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as Artifact
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as Engine
    database "Calculation Cache" as Cache
end box

== Запуск A ==

User -> FE : Отправляет BirthInput A
FE -> API : POST /charts/natal [A]
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand A

Orch -> Context : register_build(A, expected_profile_version=5)
Context -> Store : atomic increment revision
Store --> Context : BuildAttempt A\nrevision=10, expected_profile_version=5
Context --> Orch : A registered

Orch ->> Handler : execute(A)
Handler ->> Artifact : ensure_natal(A)
Artifact ->> Engine : calculate(A)

== Пользователь возвращается и отправляет более новые данные B ==

User -> FE : Закрывает и снова открывает вкладку
User -> FE : Отправляет BirthInput B
FE -> API : POST /charts/natal [B]
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand B

Orch -> Context : register_build(B, expected_profile_version=5)
Context -> Store : atomic increment revision\ncurrent_build = B
Store --> Context : BuildAttempt B\nrevision=11, expected_profile_version=5
Context --> Orch : B registered

Orch ->> Handler : execute(B)
Handler ->> Artifact : ensure_natal(B)
Artifact ->> Engine : calculate(B)

alt A завершается первым
    Engine --> Artifact : ChartArtifact A
    Artifact -> Cache : put(key_A, artifact_A)
    Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact A
    Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(A)
    Profile --> Handler : delta_A [pure, not persisted]
    Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(A, delta_A)

    Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(A, rev=10, expected=5, delta_A)
    Context -> Store : atomic CAS current_build.rev=10\nAND profile_version=5
    Store --> Context : STALE_BUILD\ncurrent_build.rev=11
    Context --> Orch : STALE_BUILD

    note over Profile, Store
    delta_A не применяется.
    Artifact A остаётся допустимым cache entry.
    end note

    Engine --> Artifact : ChartArtifact B
    Artifact -> Cache : put(key_B, artifact_B)
    Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact B
    Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(B)
    Profile --> Handler : delta_B
    Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(B, delta_B)

    Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(B, rev=11, expected=5, delta_B)
    Context -> Store : atomic CAS current_build.rev=11\nAND profile_version=5
    Store --> Context : committed\nprofile_version=6, base_chart=B\ncurrent_build=None
    Context --> Orch : success
    Orch --> API : BuildResult B
    API --> FE : Chart DTO B
    FE --> User : Показывает карту B

else B завершается первым; A — позже (N10)
    Engine --> Artifact : ChartArtifact B
    Artifact -> Cache : put(key_B, artifact_B)
    Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact B
    Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(B)
    Profile --> Handler : delta_B
    Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(B, delta_B)

    Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(B, rev=11, expected=5, delta_B)
    Context -> Store : atomic CAS current_build.rev=11\nAND profile_version=5
    Store --> Context : committed\nprofile_version=6, base_chart=B\ncurrent_build=None
    Context --> Orch : success
    Orch --> API : BuildResult B
    API --> FE : Chart DTO B
    FE --> User : Показывает карту B

    Engine --> Artifact : ChartArtifact A
    Artifact -> Cache : put(key_A, artifact_A)
    Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact A
    Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(A)
    Profile --> Handler : delta_A [pure, not persisted]
    Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(A, delta_A)

    Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(A, rev=10, expected=5, delta_A)
    Context -> Store : atomic CAS current_build.rev=10\nAND profile_version=5
    Store --> Context : STALE_BUILD\nprofile_version=6 / current build changed
    Context --> Orch : STALE_BUILD
end

note over Context, Store
Обе проверки обязательны:
1) attempt.revision == current_build.revision;
2) expected_profile_version == actual_profile_version.
Старый run не делает rollback и не меняет active_view.
end note

@enduml
